WEBVTT

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:39.010
President Lily, wait!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:42.860
No. If you want to fight...

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.020
Fortune Card!

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:03.410
The Wheel of Fortune!

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.410
Fate is in the hands of my Emperor!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.040
Begin turn.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.040
Draw.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.930
The cards are on the field.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.420
Event: Lava Flow Dive!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.440
They disappeared?

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:41.320
Did they let us go?

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:47.760
Is it okay?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.420
If they're willing to 
just stop fighting us...

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:01.820
No...

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.720
Approach with Red Dragoon.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.980
Red Dragoon

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.010
We have to fight?

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.540
Now what?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.360
So this is their Nimrod?

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.480
Damn it!

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.490
Where are they attacking from?

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.700
Over there?

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:50.170
I have to get them to realize 
that we don't want to fight.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.520
Event: Hellfire of Pele.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.130
Why is this thing so powerful?

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.500
I have to do it...

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:12.010
even if I'm fighting 
my sister's classmate!

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:16.120
Yes, you're right.

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:22.630
I'll protect you no matter what, Masaru.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.940
Even if we're fighting 
Tazuna-kun and Koyori-chan.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:31.030
Let's win, sis.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:40.410
I'll do just what you want, Masaru.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:44.490
Even if that means changing fate.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:53.160
That's your Fortune Card...

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.870
and my Emperor Card brings about the end.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.760
Wow, Lily!

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:19.510
Work harder. You can do better.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:24.190
I see... Student Council President, huh?

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.320
Work harder.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.580
I'll be eating out.

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:31.510
Bye, Dad.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:33.330
Bye.

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:35.960
I heard you got an A on your practice exams.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.360
Yes.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.570
Don't get cocky.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:39.940
Right.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:46.590
If he's leaving at this hour, 
it's got to be...

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.590
You're so smart, aren't you?

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.380
Welcome back, Masaru!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.270
Masaru!

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.980
I got a call from the school!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.610
If you don't want to go 
to school then just don't!

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:08.220
I'll tell him.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:10.450
I'll make him listen.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.770
Can I come in?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:44.630
I don't care.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.860
Did you come to yell at me?

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:53.220
Nope.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.170
I think it's important to 
have something you like.

00:07:56.930 --> 00:08:02.730
But I wish you wouldn't make Mom 
or the school worry so much.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.190
You're smart, Sis, so...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.660
You need to put a bandage on that first.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.890
It's fine.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:20.020
You're smart, but you 
always do stuff like this.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:23.640
Thank you.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:30.400
I don't care about them.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:35.560
Aww... don't say you don't 
care about Mom and Dad.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:36.880
That's not good.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.200
And...

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.460
Just say it,

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:43.040
if there's something you want to say.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.960
Um... Well...

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.700
Well...

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:49.860
Just say it!

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.350
God, you're such a pain.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:56.190
No! Don't get mad at me.

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.420
Um...

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:01.150
If you don't care about Mom and Dad...

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:02.200
Um...

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.180
At least don't make your big sister worry.

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:10.790
Could you do that?

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.440
I'm so embarrassed!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:19.700
Sis...

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.850
It hurts!

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.130
It hurts!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:26.440
Jeez, you're such a...

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.700
You okay?

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:33.020
I'm no good after all.

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:34.340
So you are okay.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.860
I'm no good... I'm just no good.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:43.120
But if you were to let me 
hold you like I used to...

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.850
I think I'd get better.

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:47.600
Are you stupid?

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.900
It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.360
You're such a pain.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:55.990
Do it!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.480
Yay!

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.780
Masaru.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:08.280
Masaru... you're so nice. I love you.

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:11.380
I don't really...

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:16.140
<i>Without me, Sis will only 
push herself too hard.</i>

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.380
<i>So I...</i>

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:20.220
Sis!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.140
It's dangerous!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.490
Take this!

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:25.140
Watch out!

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:32.310
Sis... Sis!

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:36.540
It's okay.

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:41.560
Big Sis is here for you... okay?

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.730
Fate will protect us...

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.810
Protect Masaru.

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:00.260
I know it.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.600
<i>I'm the one who'll protect us.</i>

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.470
I need to charge more.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.120
Does it hurt?

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.920
I'll make things mesh!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:46.720
<i>That isn't Takatsuki Musubu, your sister.</i>

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:57.380
If I can get close from a blind spot,
 I can make this work.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.870
Koyori?

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:02.760
Let's go!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.580
Event: Bind of Prometheus.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.130
And then use the text of Death Gaze Volcano.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:21.600
That's your dead end!

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:31.070
Approach with Flame Emperor, 
the Dragon of Burning Heavens!

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.020
It's over...

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:56.950
This is for the best.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:00.680
If you won't get hurt, this is for the best.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:02.890
Sis...

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:07.140
The Ziggurat isn't disappearing?

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:09.440
We're not done yet, Masaru.

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:10.520
Yeah.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.390
I feel bad for them, but...

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:18.770
<i>I'm just like my sister.</i>

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.400
Brother...

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.300
Don't let go of my hand...

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.540
Koyori...

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.630
Run.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.500
At this rate, you'll also...

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:51.020
Koyori...

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:05.320
It's true that I saw Musubu in you.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:07.180
I was using you as a replacement.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:13.820
But we mesh.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:15.450
I'll protect you.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.960
I'll fight for you!

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:34.070
What happened?

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.410
The location changed?

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.760
But the Ziggurat...

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:43.110
Event: Hellfire Blood Rain.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.700
Can you maybe tell how those attacks work?

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:03.180
Okay.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:05.210
Lead me, Koyori!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.450
<i>Attacks are coming just like Koyori tells me.</i>

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:31.950
<i>I can dodge them!</i>

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.560
It's meshing!

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.130
Their movements changed?

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.800
No...

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.210
They know what I'm going to do.

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:52.090
Did she figure that out just from that fight?

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:57.360
Flame Emperor can't match that speed.

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.730
What cards do I have left?

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:01.610
I see...

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:05.220
If I'm always making the best move,

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.460
that makes me easy to read, huh?

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:11.980
Sis, I'm sorry.

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:13.240
This was my mistake.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:16.230
I relied too much on your power.

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:19.640
Tazuna-kun...

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.960
President Lily, will you stop this?

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:28.620
No!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:33.240
I don't want to fight! I won't hurt you!

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.800
If you say that, I can believe it.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.640
I don't want to fight either.

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.310
Then, Sis...

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.780
But there's a wish I want to come true.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:50.100
I want to protect, and I want to win!

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.490
I see...

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:57.530
Lily, you two are actually...

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.990
I see. Mom and Dad's...

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.120
No.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:59.110
That doesn't matter!

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.110
That's not it!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.540
I...

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.800
I... I love you, Masaru!

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.650
I love you, Masaru!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:18.050
So I want to win the battle, and...

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:32.620
Let's fight after all.

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:34.280
Let's win, Sis.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.130
We'll end this!

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:49.710
We can't dodge.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.510
Let's go, Koyori.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.970
Event: Flame Pain!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:09.040
I won't lose. I'm the Dead End Emperor!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.160
Let's go, Koyori!

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.960
With you by my side I've got nothing to fear!

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.730
I've got four cards left.

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:20.860
I'll use this to get close.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.320
I can't summon fast enough...

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:28.080
so I'll attack directly for a dead end!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:34.890
You're out of cards!

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.140
You've done enough.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:38.870
Sis...?

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:46.300
I don't want to see you getting hurt anymore.

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:51.270
Give me your tarot cards.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:55.570
Believe in me.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.320
This is it...

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.280
This is my last turn!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.300
Koyori!

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:31.100
Not good enough...

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:39.940
Thanks.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.320
Masaru!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:58.340
Masaru!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.160
Masaru, hang in there!

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:02.940
Masaru!

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:04.840
That's strange. The fight ended,

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.640
but the Ziggurat's still here?

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.150
<i>It disappeared?</i>

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:25.570
Sorry... I lost.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:27.210
No.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.870
I should apologize.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:34.490
I made you go through this 
because of my selfish request.

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:39.260
And I was being weird when 
I said I love you...

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:42.240
You are weird, Sis.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.740
Really weird.

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:47.260
And I'm weird for loving you.

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:49.470
What are you going to do to fix this?

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:51.980
Masaru...

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.910
I... I...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:42.590
We're home.

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.680
Lily! Masaru!

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:45.590
You're back?

00:22:46.580 --> 00:22:47.420
Yeah...

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:50.980
Mom and I have to talk to you.

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:54.100
We'll be right there.

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:58.600
How many years has it been since 
they've been in the same room?

00:22:58.600 --> 00:22:59.290
Yeah...

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:13.280
<i>Preparations for the festival 
get more exciting by the day.</i>

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:15.660
<i>Tomoki is in big trouble 
and begs Tazuna for help.</i>

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:19.440
<i>It's more than enough reason 
for a young girl to rise up.</i>

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:22.000
<i>Sizzling frying pans, boiling pots...</i>

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:25.100
<i>Can Koyori fulfill the long-held 
desire of her old friend</i>

00:23:25.100 --> 00:23:26.920
<i>who went to train in the mountains?</i>

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:30.680
<i>Next time on Hand Shakers, Episode 7:</i>

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:33.180
<i>Festival and Carnival.</i>

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:38.550
<i>Are the true feelings hidden in 
that tiny box sweet or spicy?</i>
